fuel, so I'm going to move to an electric car. Oh, well, wait, haven't you thought about the violent production of rare earth mineral materials in West Africa, aren't you then complicit in that kind of exploitation? Oh, how wonderful that you're using a paper straw. Yes, I know, but I'm doing it on an airplane that I'm flying to California to see my family, and so I've sort of, you know, obliterated any kind of good. Don't you care? We exercise a good deal of consumer agency in the global north, but it is not a consumer

